+/**
+ * Compile a declaration that was held over, for one element (VitaSurf).
+ *
+ * The value is substituted against the variables that element was
+ * given, falling back to the document root's table, and then compiled
+ * the way it would have been had it been resolvable when it was read.
+ * The style is the caller's to cascade and destroy.
